ic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kioras-followers-2014-02-14#:~:text=%22You%20are%20on%20Theros,in%20the%20mortal%20world.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kiora's Followers\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 14 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"kioras-followers-2014-02-14-e5","era":null,"summary":"The tritons explain the Silence, saying the gods retreated into Nyx after Kruphix spoke and blaming the Sun's Champion for slaying Nylea's hydra.","participants":["kalemnos","tritons","kruphix","sun-s-champion","nylea"],"location":"siren-sea","importance":"major","page":"stories/kioras-followers-2014-02-14","order":430,"story_date":"2014-02-14","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":60,"quote":"The Sun's Champion slew Nylea's pet hydra.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kioras-followers-2014-02-14#:~:text=The%20Sun%27s%20Champion%20slew%20Nylea%27s%20pet%20hydra.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Kiora's Followers","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-02-14","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kioras-followers-2014-02-14","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kioras-followers-2014-02-14#:~:text=The%20Sun%27s%20Champion%20slew%20Nylea%27s%20pet%20hydra.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Kiora's Followers\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 14 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"kioras-followers-2014-02-14-e6","era":null,"summary":"Kiora lets the tritons believe she is a god and privately questions Kalemnos about whether he believes she is Thassa.","participants":["kiora","kalemnos","thassa"],"location":"siren-sea","importance":"major","page":"stories/kioras-followers-2014-02-14","order":430,"story_date":"2014-02-14","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":68,"quote":"\"And do you believe I am Thassa?\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/kioras-followers-2014-02-14#: